{"id":"91c9057d86d1e5c9","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-n-low-degree.md","title":"n-Low Degree","display":"df-n-low-degree — n-Low Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-n-low-degree","aliases":["68-df-n-low-degree"],"display":"df-n-low-degree — n-Low Degree","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","[[68-df-degree-jump]]","[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-n-low-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-n-low-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-n-low-degree — n-Low Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ad7581c464c34d3\" href=\"?note=4ad7581c464c34d3\" title=\"68-df-degree-jump\">68-df-degree-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。有限度跳跃见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ad7581c464c34d3\" href=\"?note=4ad7581c464c34d3\" title=\"68-df-degree-jump\">68-df-degree-jump</a>，度序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a>。以下同时定义谓词与其在 r.e. 度上的扩张集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REDeg}\">\\(\\mathrm{REDeg}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Low}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Low}_n\\)</span> 是下式定义的一元谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n\">\\(\\mathcal L_n\\)</span> 是其在 r.e. 度上的扩张。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Low}_n(\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\land \\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Low}_n(\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\land \\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}:\\mathrm{Low}_n(\\mathbf a)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}:\\mathrm{Low}_n(\\mathbf a)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>谓词与满足它的度集合显式区分，避免将谓词直接作集合包含比较。n=1 与相应 low/high 定义一致。给定 PDF 未定位到低高层级，本条保留为扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-jump","status":"resolved","id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-jump","status":"resolved","id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。有限度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。以下同时定义谓词与其在 r.e. 度上的扩张集合；$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。有限度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。以下同时定义谓词与其在 r.e. 度上的扩张集合；$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$。有限度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]。以下同时定义谓词与其在 r.e. 度上的扩张集合；$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REDeg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Low}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Low}_n(\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0'\\land \\mathbf a^{(n)}=\\mathbf0^{(n)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_n:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}:\\mathrm{Low}_n(\\mathbf a)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1423,"backlinks":[{"id":"dfaa54089e9b8340","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$。$\\mathcal L_n,\\mathrm{Low}_n$ 见 [[68-df-n-low-degree]]；$\\mathcal H_n,\\mathrm{High}_n$ 见 [[68-df-n-high-degree]]。$\\mathrm{Low},\\mathrm{High}$ 见 [[68-df-low-degree]]、[[68-df-high-degree]]；$\\mathrm{Int}$ 见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-n-low-degree]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-n-low-degree]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-n-low-degree|df-n-low-degree — n-Low Degree]]"}],"outgoing":["4516136f3cd44eb2","4ad7581c464c34d3","52c2209f400df1a9"]}